  "_comment_clips": "A3 item 2 (2026-09-30): the humanoid clip table, transcribed from the pre-refactor FSM switch and pinned by ClipSelectionTest::kLegacyTable (an independent transcription). A value is a clip name or {clip, sprint}; the sprint variant is chosen by the sprint key, or on the strafe states by the run gait band (|strafe| > 0.6) — that RULE lives in clipForState, only the NAMES live here. clipFallbacks cover the member-driven states (Block/Dodge/HitReact/Death/Celebrate/Cast) when their runtime member is empty; Attack returns its member verbatim and is deliberately absent. Must stay field-for-field equal to BodyPlan::builtinHumanoid() (BodyPlanTest pins it).",
