  "_comment_transitions": "A3 transition graph. blend = crossfade seconds (0 = hard cut; negative is clamped to 0 — it would divide by zero in the blend advance); an undeclared edge uses defaultBlend. from '*' = any source state; an exact edge beats the wildcard. phaseSync: enter the target clip at the same gait phase (stanceL markers in clip_meta, written by anim_lint.py stance --write) so walk<->run keeps the planted foot planted. Must stay equal to BodyPlan::builtinHumanoid() (BodyPlanTest pins it).",
